ES:
Esta noche es la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Luna de Otoño{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Tengo la sensación de que va
a ocurrir algo muy especial!
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}A lo mejor ya ha pasado.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Después de todo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}estoy hablando
contigo. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡Algo es algo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Stanotte c'è la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}luna d'autunno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ho la sensazione che succederà
qualcosa di speciale...
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}O forse è già successo?!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Dopotutto,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}ho incontrato te e tu sei
una persona molto speciale! Ah ah!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Die {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Nacht des Herbstmondes{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich
bin mir sicher, dass heute irgendwas
Besonderes passiert.
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oder ist es etwa schon passiert?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Immerhin bin ich dir begegnet!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Das ist doch auch was Besonderes!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Bu gece {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bu geceye türlü türlü isimler veriliyor,{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
ama ay hep aynı ay!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Kulağa romantik gelmiyor mu?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sonuçta,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} için aşk kasabası derler!
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Demiyorlar mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}O zaman demeye başlasınlar.

ES:
¡Esta noche es la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Luna de Otoño{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Cuando la luna surque el cielo,
alcanzará todo su esplendor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hay que ver, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} La luna tiene
algo mágico que nos deja a todos
embobados, ¿no te parece?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Stanotte c'è la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}luna d'autunno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
È la noche in cui la luna appare
nel suo massimo splendore{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eh eh eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} la luna ha sempre
qualcosa di magico, non trovi?

ES:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Luna de Otoño{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Tsukimi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Son algunos nombres para distintas
festividades en honor a la luna.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Ojalá algún día llegue a ser
tan famoso como nuestro satélite
y se celebren días en mi honor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
Luna d'autunno...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Tsukimi...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Ci sono vari modi per chiamare
l'evento che celebra la luna.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Vorrei tanto anch'io essere amato
da tutti come è amata la luna{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

Como estas?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Ti stai godendo
la festa della luna d'autunno? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}si festeggia anche da altre parti?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non lo sapevo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma io preferisco
comunque restare a vederla
da qui, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
